        <mxCell id="decoupleNote" value="&lt;b&gt;Requirement satisfied:&lt;/b&gt; &quot;This process should be&lt;br&gt;automated and &lt;u&gt;decoupled&lt;/u&gt; from the core&lt;br&gt;enrolment logic.&quot;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Enrolment Service publishes an event and&lt;br&gt;returns. It holds no reference to any subscriber.&lt;br&gt;New consumers are added with zero producer change." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fontSize=10;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
